OL,3,GNEWSALoophole tower reopens after
OL,4,Apre-pandemic closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FRousse Tower has reopened after being
OL,7,Fshut before the beginning of the
OL,8,FCovid-19 lockdown.
OL,10,FIt is one of 12 surviving loophole
OL,11,Ftowers of the 15 built across Guernsey
OL,12,Fduring the late 18th Century during the
OL,13,FAmerican War of Independence.
OL,15,FPreviously the inside hosted panels and
OL,16,Ffigures reflecting and explaining the
OL,17,Faim of the towers and the lives of the
OL,18,Fmilitia men and their families who
OL,19,Fserved in them. The reopening follows a
OL,20,Fprogramme of restoration and safety
OL,21,Fworks.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
